flowchart TD
    DNA["DNA<br/>(double helix)"]
    mRNA["mRNA<br/>(single strand)"]
    Ribo["Ribosome<br/>(translation machinery)"]
    Prot["Polypeptide / Protein"]
    Tx["Transcription<br/>(nucleus; RNA polymerase)"]
    Sp["RNA processing<br/>(splicing, capping, poly-A)"]
    Tl["Translation<br/>(cytoplasm; tRNA, codons)"]
    DNA --> Tx
    Tx -->|pre-mRNA| mRNA
    mRNA --> Sp
    Sp -->|mature mRNA| Ribo
    Ribo --> Tl
    Tl --> Prot